    {
      "id": 30,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        0,
        660
      ],
      "size": [
        800,
        520
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 29,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Pika H3 Flex \u2014 Image + Motion Reference Video (6-Step, 0 New Models!)\n\nTransfer **body motion, gesture timing, and camera choreography** from a reference video (`<Video 1>`) onto your character/scene image (`<Picture 1>`, optional `<Picture 2>`) in **6 steps** with native stereo audio.\n\n## Models (Reuses your existing Pika H3 Flex Ref2VA files \u2014 ZERO new downloads!)\n- `models/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors`\n- `models/loras/pika_h3_flex_ref2va_v1_bf16.safetensors`\n- `models/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors`\n- `models/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_int8_convrot.safetensors`\n- `models/vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors`\n\n## How to Use\n1. Load your **Character / Scene image** into `1. Character / Scene (<Picture 1>)` (and optional background into `<Picture 2>`, or disconnect `ref_image_1` if `<Picture 1>` already has your scene).\n2. Load your **Motion Reference Video** (2\u201315 s) into `LoadVideo`, and set `Video Slice` `start_time` / `duration` (default `0` \u2192 `5.0 s`) to grab the exact 5-second motion you want.\n   - **24 fps tip:** MiniMax H3 reads `ref_video_0` as **24 fps** without metadata \u2014 if your source clip is 30/60 fps and timing feels slightly off, convert the source clip to 24 fps first.\n   - **Want to copy the video's audio too?** Link `GetVideoComponents.audio` \u2192 `MiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo.ref_video_audio_0` and reference `<Audio 1>` in the prompt.\n3. **Want frame 0 locked tightly to your starting image?** Select `Optional START frame pin` + `Optional START guide @ frame 0` and press **Ctrl+B** to un-bypass.\n4. **Need exact limb-for-limb dance/skeleton lock?** Use `MiniMax-H3_FunControlNet_PosePlusImage.json` in this same folder.\n5. Start at **`0.5 MP` (`960\u00d7544`)** on RTX 3090, then raise to **`0.98 MP` (`1344\u00d7768`)** for finals.\n"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "# Pika H3 Flex \u2014 Image + Motion Reference Video (6-Step, 0 New Models!)\n\nTransfer **body motion, gesture timing, and camera choreography** from a reference video (`<Video 1>`) onto your character/scene image (`<Picture 1>`, optional `<Picture 2>`) in **6 steps** with native stereo audio.\n\n## Models (Reuses your existing Pika H3 Flex Ref2VA files \u2014 ZERO new downloads!)\n- `models/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors`\n- `models/loras/pika_h3_flex_ref2va_v1_bf16.safetensors`\n- `models/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors`\n- `models/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_int8_convrot.safetensors`\n- `models/vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors`\n\n## How to Use\n1. Load your **Character / Scene image** into `1. Character / Scene (<Picture 1>)` (and optional background into `<Picture 2>`, or disconnect `ref_image_1` if `<Picture 1>` already has your scene).\n2. Load your **Motion Reference Video** (2\u201315 s) into `LoadVideo`, and set `Video Slice` `start_time` / `duration` (default `0` \u2192 `5.0 s`) to grab the exact 5-second motion you want.\n   - **24 fps tip:** MiniMax H3 reads `ref_video_0` as **24 fps** without metadata \u2014 if your source clip is 30/60 fps and timing feels slightly off, convert the source clip to 24 fps first.\n   - **Want to copy the video's audio too?** Link `GetVideoComponents.audio` \u2192 `MiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo.ref_video_audio_0` and reference `<Audio 1>` in the prompt.\n3. **Want frame 0 locked tightly to your starting image?** Select `Optional START frame pin` + `Optional START guide @ frame 0` and press **Ctrl+B** to un-bypass.\n4. **Need exact limb-for-limb dance/skeleton lock?** Use `MiniMax-H3_FunControlNet_PosePlusImage.json` in this same folder.\n5. Start at **`0.5 MP` (`960\u00d7544`)** on RTX 3090, then raise to **`0.98 MP` (`1344\u00d7768`)** for finals.\n"
      },
      "title": "HOW TO: Image + Motion Video Transfer (Pika H3 Flex 6-Step)",
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    }
